<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission approves rice, malt import rules.</title>
<headline>EU Commission approves rice, malt import rules.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had formally approved a new cumulative recovery system for husked rice which allows traders to reclaim excess import duties.</p>
<p>The Commission also approved without discussion a quota for imports of 30,000 tonnes of U.S. malting barley at a reduced tariff of 50 percent.</p>
</text>
